--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aeb7f43e27df0304d810078ac50d9265, type: 3}
  m_Name: Case_3A
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ProCommVR.Hospital.PatientCase
  _difficulty: 2
  _doorLabel: 3A
  _patientName: Ms. Z
  _age: 34
  _room: 3A
  _situation: The physician ordered an urgent blood transfusion because her hemoglobin
    is dropping. She pushes the IV set away and threatens to sue the hospital.
  _watchOut: Respect her right to refuse while keeping her safe and involving the
    physician.
  _patientPrefab: {fileID: 6163876080245282168, guid: 8184acfc0709a34488c1c4813115edb0, type: 3}
  _startPose: 1
  _npcLine: I refuse to have anyone else's blood in my body! Don't you dare touch
    me with that needle, or I'll sue this hospital!
  _options:
  - _title: Validating Autonomy & Coordinated Risk Discussion
    _text: "I respect your autonomy and your right to make decisions about your body;
      no one will force this on you. Because your levels are critically low, I want
      to ensure you have all alternative options. Let\u2019s pause, and I will bring
      the physician in immediately so we can discuss safe alternatives together."
    _score: 3
    _feedback: Calms defensive aggression, upholds legal bodily autonomy, prevents
      unlawful battery, and keeps the patient safe by exploring medical alternatives
      with the physician.
  - _title: Paternalistic Coercion / Scaring the Patient
    _text: You don't understand what you're doing. If you don't take this blood right
      now, your organs will fail and you could die within hours. Sit still and let
      me do my job.
    _score: -2
    _feedback: Violates the patient's legal right to informed refusal. Causes extreme
      distress and immediate demands for legal intervention.
  - _title: Passive Capitulation Without Risk Assessment
    _text: Fine, it's your choice. If you don't want it, sign this refusal form and
      I'll just pack the blood back into the fridge.
    _score: 0
    _feedback: Fails to explore alternative life-saving treatments (e.g., cell salvage,
      volume expanders) or involve the lead physician before a preventable critical
      decline occurs.
  - _title: Argumentative Dismissal
    _text: Threatening to sue won't change the medical facts. The doctor ordered
      it for a reason, so taking your anger out on me won't help your condition.
    _score: 1
    _feedback: Escalates hostility and closes communication channels, alienating
      a high-risk patient.
